# The log sources for this server are declared one file per source in
# acquis.d/. This file is deliberately empty.
#
# It replaces the nginx, syslog and apache sources that the image ships with,
# because none of those files exist on this server. Without this replacement
# CrowdSec logs a "datasource unavailable" error for every one of them.
#
# An empty file is safe: CrowdSec skips empty acquisition documents.
